                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5101994-768a-3b13-a1c1-19931d39720f",
                        "entry_id": "e352e2ac-5e4b-391e-b377-226cd549e574",
                        "glosses": [
                            "жанр античной поэзии, идеализированно изображающий пастушескую жизнь"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b80cabe-fcfa-4925-9f0f-8de99be4947d",
                                "sense_id": "d5101994-768a-3b13-a1c1-19931d39720f",
                                "text": "Чем реалистичнее выписывались подробности пастушеского быта — запах козьих шкур, циновки убогих хижин, пересчет стад, нехитрые трапезы, крепкие перебранки, песенные переклички, явно производящие подлинные народные запевки, — тем выигрышнее это было для греческой буколики."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "223f0fd4-7d51-46a1-9d44-6e49d8ad1f28",
                        "source_entry_id": "e352e2ac-5e4b-391e-b377-226cd549e574",
                        "source_sense_id": "d5101994-768a-3b13-a1c1-19931d39720f",
                        "target_lang_word": "bucolic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bucolic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc8798a9-8f4f-30fd-9d2a-a318a9089ec8",
                                        "entry_id": "83b47f9e-b1e8-3586-8919-86773168b2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rustic, pastoral, country-styled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c3ff309-99c7-41a2-9ef6-09970c0dd6d5",
                                                "sense_id": "dc8798a9-8f4f-30fd-9d2a-a318a9089ec8",
                                                "text": "The countryside was filled with charming, bucolic scenery, complete with rolling hills, fields of wildflowers, and quaint farmhouses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7791ed6d-25d1-4db1-8ee5-de1421aff551",
                                                "sense_id": "dc8798a9-8f4f-30fd-9d2a-a318a9089ec8",
                                                "text": "A couple of years later the Metropolitan had reached its own most northerly point, Verney Junction, which was as bucolic as it sounds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bdc0aab-50f1-48a0-af19-3b5123e7a2c0",
                                                "sense_id": "dc8798a9-8f4f-30fd-9d2a-a318a9089ec8",
                                                "text": "Before the area was a tech epicenter, it was a bucolic land of fruit orchards."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5011f73-d750-3cf1-8129-a5906965a9d8",
                                        "entry_id": "83b47f9e-b1e8-3586-8919-86773168b2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to the pleasant aspects of rustic country life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6554485-b33b-4869-adb2-8290bc1b470a",
                                                "sense_id": "f5011f73-d750-3cf1-8129-a5906965a9d8",
                                                "text": "The cozy bed and breakfast was located in a picturesque, bucolic setting, offering guests a chance to escape the city and enjoy the simple pleasures of the countryside."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a91f797b-74cc-4426-9b49-f707965fb301",
                                                "sense_id": "f5011f73-d750-3cf1-8129-a5906965a9d8",
                                                "text": "In a sense, Mr. Maillier is living the classic French dream – working the land in the bucolic countryside, feeding his children good food, and keeping France’s gastronomic heritage alive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee90814b-9d42-3402-9f80-0c885a22b0b7",
                                        "entry_id": "83b47f9e-b1e8-3586-8919-86773168b2d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to herdsmen or peasants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0cab98b-aa6c-42de-b3e8-9d94a1a365be",
                                                "sense_id": "ee90814b-9d42-3402-9f80-0c885a22b0b7",
                                                "text": "Their traditional clothing and simple way of life reflected their bucolic roots as a community of shepherds and farmers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "124b211a-a258-4369-ba5d-1bb52a23f4f5",
                                                "sense_id": "ee90814b-9d42-3402-9f80-0c885a22b0b7",
                                                "text": "Here we consider a bucolic example."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
